  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I often used screenshots to remember linking their names to their avatars in VR mode.\n\nSince the update earlier this month, names no longer appear in screenshots taken in VR mode.\n\nIs this a spec change or a glitch? If the former, I would like to see a \"Take Screenshot with Nameplate\" or \"Take Screenshot of Social's In Room\" button for VR user.\n\n(Desktop users can save by using steam's screenshot key and so on.)\n\n(I used DeepL translations.)",
